   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A vast company with shields",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the latter years you will invade",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A land that has recovered from war",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "People gathered to the mountains of Israel",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Living in safety and peace",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will come like a storm on the land",
   "heard": 9,
